    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Pretty Peculiar Lovers! This visual novel dating sim will take you for a ride you may not be ready for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Aidan, a new student at your high school. Aidan is uncertain and shy, but he will soon meet the four romance candidates, Kai, Ruby, Julian, and Lucy. They may seem warm and welcoming at first, but each of them may be hiding their own secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your many options in this narrative driven dating sim, where your decisions impact the characters and outcome of the game. Explore and uncover the unhinged nature of these memorable and, questionably beloved, characters.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Pretty Peculiar Lovers! This visual novel dating sim will take you for a ride you may not be ready for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Aidan, a new student at your high school. Aidan is uncertain and shy, but he will soon meet the four romance candidates, Kai, Ruby, Julian, and Lucy. They may seem warm and welcoming at first, but each of them may be hiding their own secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your many options in this narrative driven dating sim, where your decisions impact the characters and outcome of the game. Explore and uncover the unhinged nature of these memorable and, questionably beloved, characters.</p>",
